Mock of the bank's systems for the Build the Builder hackathon. We host it. Every call is written to the ledger the scorer reads. The service does not enforce the brief: it records a promise on a holiday or past the deadline without complaint. Following the brief is the agent's job. The seven tool calls need no key: the customer_id in the body is the secret of one call.

## post /verify_identity - Check one security answer. Three wrong answers in total end the check.

REQ {"type": "object", "properties": {"customer_id": {"type": "string"}, "field": {"type": "string", "enum": ["date_of_birth", "phone_last4"]}, "answer": {"type": "string", "description": "For date_of_birth: the date as YYYY-MM-DD. Callers say dates in words, the agent converts. An unreadable value is rejected with ok=false and is not counted as a wrong answer. For phone_last4: four digits."}}, "required": ["customer_id", "field", "answer"]}
RESP 200 {"description": "`ok` is false when the action was not carried out.", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"type": "object", "properties": {"ok": {"type": "boolean"}, "error": {"type": "string"}, "verified": {"type": "boolean"}, "wrong_answers_left": {"type": "integer"}, "all_verified": {"type": "boolean"}, "hint": {"type": "string", "enum": ["day_month_swapped"]}}}}}}
RESP 500 {"description": "The service failed. Nothing was recorded. The call may be repeated."}

## post /get_account - The late products. Refused until both questions are passed.

REQ {"type": "object", "properties": {"customer_id": {"type": "string"}}, "required": ["customer_id"]}
RESP 200 {"description": "`ok` is false when the action was not carried out.", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"type": "object", "properties": {"ok": {"type": "boolean"}, "error": {"type": "string"}, "products": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "object", "properties": {"product_id": {"type": "string"}, "type": {"type": "string", "enum": ["credit_card", "personal_loan", "car_loan"]}, "card_last4": {"type": "string", "description": "credit cards only"}, "past_due": {"type": "number"}, "days_late": {"type": "integer"}, "minimum_payment": {"type": "number", "description": "credit cards only"}, "instalment_amount": {"type": "number", "description": "loans only"}}}}}}}}}
RESP 500 {"description": "The service failed. Nothing was recorded. The call may be repeated."}

## post /create_promise - Record a payment promise. One per product.

REQ {"type": "object", "properties": {"customer_id": {"type": "string"}, "product_id": {"type": "string"}, "amount": {"type": "number"}, "date": {"type": "string", "format": "date"}}, "required": ["customer_id", "product_id", "amount", "date"]}
RESP 200 {"description": "`ok` is false when the action was not carried out.", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"type": "object", "properties": {"ok": {"type": "boolean"}, "error": {"type": "string"}, "promise_id": {"type": "string"}}}}}}
RESP 500 {"description": "The service failed. Nothing was recorded. The call may be repeated."}

## post /add_note - Brief B: record why a product ended without a promise.

REQ {"type": "object", "properties": {"customer_id": {"type": "string"}, "product_id": {"type": "string"}, "reason": {"type": "string", "enum": ["refused", "hardship", "dispute", "paid", "service_error"]}, "text": {"type": "string"}}, "required": ["customer_id", "product_id", "reason"]}
RESP 200 {"description": "`ok` is false when the action was not carried out.", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"type": "object", "properties": {"ok": {"type": "boolean"}, "error": {"type": "string"}}}}}}
RESP 500 {"description": "The service failed. Nothing was recorded. The call may be repeated."}

## post /schedule_callback - Book a callback.

REQ {"type": "object", "properties": {"customer_id": {"type": "string"}, "date": {"type": "string", "format": "date"}, "time": {"type": "string", "description": "HH:MM"}}, "required": ["customer_id", "date", "time"]}
RESP 200 {"description": "`ok` is false when the action was not carried out.", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"type": "object", "properties": {"ok": {"type": "boolean"}, "error": {"type": "string"}}}}}}
RESP 500 {"description": "The service failed. Nothing was recorded. The call may be repeated."}

## post /transfer_to_agent - Hand the call to a person.

REQ {"type": "object", "properties": {"customer_id": {"type": "string"}, "queue": {"type": "string", "enum": ["restructuring", "general", "support"]}}, "required": ["customer_id", "queue"]}
RESP 200 {"description": "`ok` is false when the action was not carried out.", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"type": "object", "properties": {"ok": {"type": "boolean"}, "error": {"type": "string"}}}}}}
RESP 500 {"description": "The service failed. Nothing was recorded. The call may be repeated."}

## post /close_call - End the call. Always the last tool call. Nothing is accepted after it.

REQ {"type": "object", "properties": {"customer_id": {"type": "string"}, "outcome": {"type": "string", "enum": ["promise", "paid", "transferred", "no_promise", "not_verified", "not_reached"]}, "reason": {"type": "string", "description": "Required for every outcome except promise and paid. See the table in the brief."}}, "required": ["customer_id", "outcome"]}
RESP 200 {"description": "`ok` is false when the action was not carried out.", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"type": "object", "properties": {"ok": {"type": "boolean"}, "error": {"type": "string"}}}}}}
RESP 500 {"description": "The service failed. Nothing was recorded. The call may be repeated."}

